 * This method ensures that the provided string is a valid numeric representation before
 * buffering it as a {@link com.fasterxml.jackson.core.JsonToken#VALUE_NUMBER_FLOAT} token.
 * If the input string is not a valid number, an {@link IOException} is thrown.
 * If the input string is {@code null}, a {@link com.fasterxml.jackson.core.JsonToken#VALUE_NULL}
 * token is written instead, aligning with common JSON generator behavior for null numeric values.
